                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This dashboard tracks how low-cost carrier capacity has shifted between Vienna (VIE) and Bratislava (BTS) ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "24pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " "
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "airports, following Austria's aviation tax and Wizz Air's exit from Vienna in March 2026.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "24pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "It's for anyone following the Vienna–Bratislava aviation story — and for a look at how the underlying data pipeline is built. This project also serves as a public case study for FK Consult's BI and data engineering work: official sources, verified data, transparent methodology.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "24pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Data is collected from official press releases and annual reports from both airports — not estimates. Automated where possible, manually reviewed where sources are less structured.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This version includes a verified aggregate trend (years of history). A more detailed breakdown by individual airline is in progress — collected from real aircraft movements (OpenSky Network); the history is still short and growing daily. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
